      },
      "lineNbr": 417,
      "author": {
        "id": 3733880
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-22T02:57:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure if `__has_feature(bounds_attributes)` or `__has_feature(bounds_safety_attributes)` are ever true even if -fbounds-safety is not set. I think that would be the only case.\n\nOtherwise we can remove this variable entirely and trust that if the compiler advertises support, it\u0027s because its enabled and available",
      "parentUuid": "dd1e573c_c1271806",
      "revId": "6018b88715edc11413ce56e0902bb32c5bdd1e27",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
